TEXT -40 272 Left 2 !.param Vin2={100k*1.414/1.73205}
TEXT 96 56 Left 2 ;For filtering out 50Hz signal:\nuse 5th_order_48Hz_52Hz_stop!\nset fn1 to 60Hz and simulate \nNow you can see only the 100kV 60Hz signal\nAlternately you can use the\n5th_order_58Hz_62Hz_pass filter!
